    "detailed_description": "<h1>Development &amp; Feedback Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/1e440d1abe5b6bd59490bc809251913a.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Select Classes and Talents that compliment your playstyle such as Builder or Mage, unlock more classes &amp; talents by completing objectives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/a52cd6161a0623420a0efef8e94b7117.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Unlock new towers and upgrade them to improve their stats. Improve attack towers with other towers or buffs to create devastating effects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/0c15510ad41c39e30723856bf02654a0.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Cast down powers on invaders to deal massive damage with meteors, lightning strikes, overcharges, and more..<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/0789f117419ed032b195525647b2983c.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Create an endless number of custom worlds, play through the included levels, or enjoy those created and shared by others.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/1e440d1abe5b6bd59490bc809251913a.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Select Classes and Talents that compliment your playstyle such as Builder or Mage, unlock more classes &amp; talents by completing objectives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/a52cd6161a0623420a0efef8e94b7117.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Unlock new towers and upgrade them to improve their stats. Improve attack towers with other towers or buffs to create devastating effects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/0c15510ad41c39e30723856bf02654a0.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Cast down powers on invaders to deal massive damage with meteors, lightning strikes, overcharges, and more..<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837190/extras/0789f117419ed032b195525647b2983c.avif?t=1722821173\" /></div><br>Create an endless number of custom worlds, play through the included levels, or enjoy those created and shared by others.",
